.TH CONTADOR-CARPETAS 1 "2026-11-16" "1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
contador-carpetas \- count and sort folders recursively
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B contador-carpetas
.RI [ directory ]
.br
.B contador-carpetas --version
.SH DESCRIPTION
A native GTK 3 application showing immediate subfolders ranked by recursive
file count, allocated disk space, apparent size or name.
The interface is in Spanish. Select a directory and press Analizar.
Click column headings to change the sort order. Detener cancels traversal.
Double-click a folder to analyze it. Archivo provides CSV export.
Symbolic links are ignored. Other filesystems are skipped unless enabled
in Opciones. Hard links count once per directory entry.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/contador-carpetas/settings.json
.br
.I ~/.local/state/contador-carpetas/errors.log
.br
XDG_CONFIG_HOME and XDG_STATE_HOME override the corresponding base paths.
